            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "不好了！那只龙蜥醒了！我们快跑！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740840704"
            ]
          },
          "740840704": {
            "id": "740840704",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "祭坛旁的龙蜥摇晃着醒来，双眼喷出愤怒与恶意…\\n你们急忙向岸上游去…但它在后面紧追不舍…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7408408",
      "subQuestName": "与美露莘对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740840801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740840801": {
            "id": "740840801",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "珀西芙",
            "text": "…美露莘！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740840802"
            ]
          },
          "740840802": {
            "id": "740840802",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "珀西芙，你怎么在这里？快离开那只龙蜥，很危险！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740840803"
            ]
          },
          "740840803": {
